From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Graphics: Direct3D 11, ANGLE on a SwapChainPanel, WebRender
 on the phone's GPUs

Hardware WebRender through ANGLE presenting into the shell's
SwapChainPanel, the D3D11 compositor for GPUs that stop at feature level
9_3, the phone GPUs treated as known vendors, and a smaller texture cache.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
